      `I had alcohol in my blood when I drove or rode` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether you had any alcohol in your blood when you drove or rode
      `my blood alcohol content, g per 100 mL` IS A NUMBER @desc Your blood alcohol content, in grams of alcohol per 100 mL of blood (0.05 is 0.05)
