      `my vehicle is one s 64A(5) lists` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether your vehicle is one s 64A(5) lists: a bus with passengers, a vehicle carrying passengers for hire, a GCM of 22.5 t or more, or dangerous goods
      `which drink-driving offence of mine this is` IS A NUMBER @desc 1 for your first offence under this section, 2 for your second, and so on
