        ELSE `yes if` (`Must I be disqualified for driving unlicensed` (`the drive built from` FALSE `I was authorised under the ATD Act Part 2 all the same` `the vehicle was driven under the s 11(1) regulations or a s 49A necessity permit` `why I was not authorised` FALSE))
    OTHERWISE `does not arise for you`

